      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطُفَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a thing) <i>was small,</i> or <i>little;</i> (S,
Msb, K, KL;) and <i>slender, thin,</i> or <i>fine:</i> (K,
KL:) and <i>elegant,</i> or <i>graceful.</i> (KL.)

